Error Analysis Describe and correct the error a student made in finding the rule for the composition f \circ g of the functions f(x) = 3x^2 - x + 2 and g(x) = 2x + 1.
\begin{align*}
f \circ g &= f(g(x)) 
&= 3(2x + 1)^2 - 2x + 1 + 2 
&= 3(4x^2 + 4x + 1) - 2x + 1 + 2 
&= 12x^2 + 12x + 3 - 2x + 1 + 2 
&= 12x^2 + 10x + 6 \text{\Large \textcolor{red}{X}}
\end{align*}

